WEBVTT

00:06:28.655 --> 00:06:32.078
reveling in the joy that they got
a full night's sleep

00:06:32.102 --> 00:06:33.963
with the aid of the sleep drug.

00:06:35.220 --> 00:06:37.002
Because of FDA regulations,

00:06:37.026 --> 00:06:42.423
the last few seconds of this one-minute ad
needs to be devoted to the side effects

00:06:42.447 --> 00:06:44.038
of that drug.

00:06:44.062 --> 00:06:49.150
And what you'll typically hear
is a hurried voice-over that blurts out

00:06:49.174 --> 00:06:52.587
"Side effects include
heart attack, stroke,

00:06:52.611 --> 00:06:55.048
blah, blah, blah,"

00:06:55.072 --> 00:06:57.829
and will end with something
like "itchy feet."

00:06:58.542 --> 00:06:59.834
(Laughter)

00:06:59.858 --> 00:07:02.927
Guess what "itchy feet" does
to people's risk assessment